Package: griffin-persona
Version: 1.5.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Bobby Comet
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, polkitd, pkexec, pciutils, wget, ca-certificates, gnupg
Recommends: wine, winetricks, vulkan-tools, mesa-vulkan-drivers, pipewire, wireplumber, mangohud, gamemode, ubuntu-drivers-common, vainfo
Suggests: lutris, steam-installer, timeshift, flatpak, fwupd, vkmark
Homepage: https://griffinlinux.org
Description: Griffin Linux post-install configuration center
 Griffin Persona builds your computer's persona: browsers and everyday
 apps, Windows compatibility (Wine/Proton), GPU drivers, audio, gaming
 tools, creative software, storage/reliability, and development basics.
 Every change is previewed in plain language before it's applied, never
 installed blindly. Includes a single-page system diagnostics checklist
 with one-click repair.
 .
 Runs once automatically on first boot to introduce itself, then behaves
 as an ordinary application reachable from the application menu.
